{
  "v": 11,
  "label": "a pending create beside a round parked on a mass absence derives no add",
  "note": "the round lists one of the 20 based bindings in its scope, the 19 others absent: more than half of at least 20, so the round parks, drops nothing and stays open with its checkpoint (SYNC.md §5). A pending create of this source, staged with no origin, waits beside it: an Add is derived only once the last page of the round has landed, and a parked round's last page lands as a page before the last does, so no Add is pushed while the round stays open, a page of the round listed again possibly carrying the create's own arrival. The create is no member a listing names and is not counted among the based bindings. The next run lists the round again from its first page and, once it closes, pushes the add",
